{
  "id": "section-haunted-house-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Haunted House table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,22,47]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,47,49]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Poltergeist. As you step inside, d6 objects fly at you. Defend against\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,49,120]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "each as if it were a level 3 attack. Find 1 random object from the Useful\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,120,194]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Stuff table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,194,207]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,207,209]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The house is possessed by an evil entity. If you have the Faith Skill\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,209,279]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and the Exorcism ritual, you may try to exorcise the house as an L5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,279,347]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Demon. If you fail the Exorcism attempt, lose 1 Sanity and 1 Life. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,347,417]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you succeed, gain 1 XP. Loot: 1 random book (reroll if it is a book you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,417,489]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "already possess).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,489,507]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,507,509]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "This house had an impressive occult library . Roll twice on the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,509,573]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Random Book table. You may take one or both books (reroll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,573,631]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "duplicates). When you leave, you are attacked by a random creature\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,631,698]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from the Demonic Horrors table. If you took two books, the creature\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,698,766]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will have +1 to its L.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,766,789]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,789,791]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Rosen House (UNIQUE LOCATION). The Rosens were rumored\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,791,850]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to be devil worshippers who kidnapped children for sacrifices. The\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,850,917]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "walls are covered with newspaper clippings and outside the house\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,917,982]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "there is a huge, ancient walnut tree where the Rosens were rumored\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,982,1049]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to hang their victims. If you want to investigate, go to unique event\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1049,1119]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#17. In any case, mark the location of the Rosen house on your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1119,1182]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "exploration map. It will remain the same for the whole campaign.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1182,1247]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Reroll if you already found the Rosen House.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1247,1292]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1292,1294]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "This building is a small puppet theatre. You are surrounded by many,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1294,1363]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "evil-looking puppets that have somehow taken a life of their own. “Tell\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1363,1435]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "us a funny joke or we will kill you and use your bones to make more\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1435,1503]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of us!”. If you have a book of jokes with you, you automatically\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1503,1568]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "appease them. Otherwise, make a L5 Charisma roll to improvise a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1568,1632]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "joke. Add +1 if you have the Charisma Skill, +2 if you have Charisma\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1632,1701]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(Expert). If they are not entertained, you will have to fight them.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1701,1769]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Haunted Puppets, L4 animated object, immune to poison, vulnerable to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1769,1838]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fire. Treat as a single L4 creature with 4 Life, inflicting 1 damage on a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1838,1912]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "successful hit. You are surrounded and you may NOT use a grenade\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1912,1977]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "here. If you use a Molotov cocktail here, you will lose 1 Life.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,1977,2041]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6 Amusement park. If you have a train ticket, you may pay for a ride\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,2041,2110]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-haunted-house-table:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and go to event #24. Otherwise, nothing happens.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[50,2110,2158]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    50
  ]
}
